From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:50:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(coach): fresh Health Connect figures everywhere and the
 full picture for the coach
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The coach quoted yesterday's weight after a morning weigh-in: «Mi día» reads
Health Connect live, but the coach, Food balance and profile read the store,
which the full import refreshes only on app open every 6-24 h (10-year read).

- VictorHcRefresh: two-day top-up of steps, calories, the smart-scale weigh-in
  (weight, fat, lean, bone, water, BMR, BMI) and blood pressure, with the full
  import's rules; fills or updates columns, never blanks. Throttled (2 min),
  runs on Today resume, on opening Food and before every coach reply (8 s cap).
- Coach context: DATA AS OF line (the block rides in the first turn, so it
  states it supersedes figures quoted earlier), weigh-in time in BODY, the
  Settings weight left out when the scale has one, STRESS as the Stress screen
  scores it (0-3, recent days, today by the hour), WATER and FITNESS
  (VO2max, fitness age).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
